+    0.6 so the identity survives. Only a gender change regenerates; a regeneration (and the
+    inpaint-failure fallback) still carries every earlier edit in its prompt, so nothing the
+    witness added is lost. Edits are applied at turn commit, not from half-spoken preview words.
